## Verification Rules

All TimeSeries within a TimeSeriesDataSet shall have TimeIntervals with the same starting and ending timestamps.

## Publishing Rules

This data model does not consider the quality of the source data: whether the data in a given dataset are "correct" or "true" for a given location and time. It defines the structures for exchanging data and leaves judgment about the quality or appropriateness of the data to data publishers and users. Data providers using this model are encouraged to cite sources where possible. Providers are also encouraged to document the calculation behind each statistic in the relevant `notes` fields and to reference the original source.

## Application Rules

- Climate zones listed for a location apply to that location only, not to a "nearby" site.
- Every 12-value monthly array (a `monthly` block, a degree-day `monthly` array, an optical-depth series) is ordered January to December: index 0 is January and index 11 is December.
